ntions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m003-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"秦昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004480","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m003-0008","start":8,"end":12,"surface":"謁者王稽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004481","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m003-0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"鄭安平","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004479","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m003-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"王稽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004481","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m003-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"王稽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004481","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m003-0031","start":31,"end":35,"surface":"魏有賢人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、族屬或未定個體保存，不補未見姓名與成員；魏之諸公子不補魏齊父親。"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m003-0044","start":44,"end":47,"surface":"鄭安平","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004479","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m003-0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004479","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m003-0054","start":54,"end":58,"surface":"張祿先生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004472","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m003-0061","start":61,"end":62,"surface":"君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004481","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m003-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"王稽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004481","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m003-0090","start":90,"end":93,"surface":"鄭安平","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004479","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m003-0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"張祿","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004472","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m003-0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"王稽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004481","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m003-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"王稽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004481","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m003-0108","start":108,"end":110,"surface":"范睢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004472","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m003-0116","start":116,"end":118,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004472","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-079-fancai","book_id":"b-shiji-079","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-079-fancai"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:p022","text":"范睢既相，王稽謂范睢曰：「事有不可知者三，有不柰何者亦三。宮車一日晏駕，是事之不可知者一也。君卒然捐館舍，是事之不可知者二也。使臣卒然填溝壑，是事之不可知者三也。宮車一日晏駕，君雖恨於臣，無可柰何。君卒然捐館舍，君雖恨於臣，亦無可柰何。使臣卒然填溝壑，君雖恨於臣，亦無可柰何。」范睢不懌，乃入言於王曰：「非王稽之忠，莫能內臣於函谷關；非大王之賢聖，莫能貴臣。今臣官至於相，爵在列侯，王稽之官尚止於謁者，非其內臣之意也。」昭王召王稽，拜為河東守，三歲不上計。又任鄭安平，昭王以為將軍。范睢於是散家財物，盡以報所嘗困戹者。一飯之德必償，睚眥之怨必報。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m022-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"范睢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004472","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m022-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"王稽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004481","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m022-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"范睢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004472","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m022-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"宮車","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名角色或擬托身分保留，不補姓名；主人翁是范睢微行語境未核角色，先人不補父親。"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m022-0046","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004472","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m022-0064","start":64,"end":65,"surface":"臣"